  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rusitu SS Dairy Production and Marketing Expansion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Agriculture. Dairy.Beneficiaries: 210, of which 30 are women.Project Description: The project will assess the current herd size and dispose of nonproductive cows, replacing them with pure breed dairy cows. Farmers will increase production, processing and preservation of forage crops that are nutritionally balanced and adequate to cover animal feeding both in and out of season. USADF funds will be used to procure dairy farm equipment that will increase efficiency in production and processing, such as a tractor and associated implements ie disc harrow, planter, trailer with side beds, silage cutter. The project will purchase 50 pure bred dairy cows through a cattle revolving loan and provide for forage inputs in a stock feed revolving loan will boost production. The project will fund trainings in groups on leadership issues, herd management, dairy business management including strategies to reduce costs at the farm level. .</narrative>
  </description>
